id: GUIDE7-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: hint_instance_key
target: crates/core/src/session.rs
find:             .filter(|(uid, _)| uid.root() == *root)
replace:             .filter(|(uid, _)| uid.0.starts_with(root.0.as_str()))
expect-fail: a_root_total_does_not_include_a_longer_root_name
note: 根の比較を文字列の前方一致に替え、m@r10 の段数が m@r1 の合計に混ざる
